{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"09d27a55e23f0042ba096ed63e33a748cb4e944e664ac5e7d437375198cfe694","digest":{"component_or_area":"doctor command mapping diagnostics","key_entities":["src/rebar/_commands/doctor.py","mapping_config.load_mapping_config","MappingConfigError","config.projects","mapping_probe.build_probe","effective_status_map","effective_type_map","assert_type_decisions_complete","effective_link_map","capability_installed","jira_datacenter","JIRA_PAT","resolve_jira_datacenter_settings","docs/user-guide.md"],"problem_keywords":["mapping config diagnostics","offline validation","live drift detection","portability","jira datacenter optional","graceful degradation"],"propositions":["Offline mapping config validation must catch load-time errors (non-integer hierarchy, malformed vocabulary blocks) and resolve-time errors (out-of-vocabulary values, unmapped-non-skipped entries) as error findings with non-zero exit","Mapping diagnostics must run without the jira-datacenter extra installed or credentials set, with offline checks always available and live-drift checks gracefully degrading to unavailable findings","Live-drift detection must compare configured vocabulary (status, type, link) against live Jira observations via the mapping_probe reader, excluding hierarchy since Data Center does not expose hierarchyLevel","All degradation causes (missing extra, empty PAT, settings ConfigError, probe timeout) must fold into a single unavailable finding with appropriate reason and maintain success exit code","Empty projects blocks must surface as warning findings (not errors) to distinguish legitimate stubs from configuration problems","The mapping diagnostics findings list must remain separate from scan-dirty/lock reports and excluded from run_repair iteration to preserve doctor.scan() blocking-edge contract"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787551504071986001,"uuid":"3506ff2f-6135-4d59-9cdb-fb5320c40aeb"}